    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "2a0d9466-d89b-4c0b-a1c7-062034d053d1",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Black Transplants",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110384431401",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6c09bd70-6670-486b-9222-15db93222b56).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Hokkaido, 47.\r\rOur targets are convicted a crime of black transplantology, all around the world. They were spotted in Serbia, Brazil, India and Ukraine. Clinic owner and head transplant specialist harvesting organs by illigally ways, without donor consent, especially children. \r\rAnd arms dealer who helps them find suitable bodies helps them as well. \rIronically, he&apos;s also in this clinic waiting for a liver transplant..\r\rRemove these targets, the world will be cleaner.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
